This file is a placeholder for the network-architecture.png diagram.

When creating this diagram, please follow these guidelines:
1. The diagram should illustrate the comprehensive network architecture of the VIP Platform
2. Include all VPCs/VNets, subnets, and their CIDR allocations
3. Show connectivity between networks, including peering, transit gateways, and VPN connections
4. Illustrate security groups, NACLs, and other network security controls
5. Use the standard color scheme and symbols from our diagram guidelines
6. Export as PNG with a resolution of at least 1200x800
7. Include a legend explaining all symbols used

Please replace this placeholder with the actual diagram when complete. 